 ' — Agent 监管系统监控台第 ' + c.id + ' 项监管机制：' + c.en + '。\">',\n'  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#07110f\">',\n'  <title>' + c.id + ' ' + c.name + ' · Agent 监管系统监控台</title>',\n'  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/style.css\">',\n'</head>',\n'<body class=\"mechanism-page\">',\n'  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">跳到主要内容</a>',\n'  <div class=\"ambient ambient-a\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>',\n'  <div class=\"ambient ambient-b\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>',\n'',\n'  <header class=\"topbar\">',\n'    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"../index.html\" aria-label=\"Agent 监管系统监控台首页\">',\n'      <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>',\n'      <span class=\"brand-type\">',\n'        <strong>Agent Oversight</strong>',\n'        <small>监管系统监控台</small>',\n'      </span>',\n'    </a>',\n'    <nav class=\"topnav\" aria-label=\"页面导航\">',\n'      <a href=\"../index.html#mechanisms\">机制矩阵</a>',\n'      <a href=\"../index.html#control-loop\">监管闭环</a>',\n'      <a href=\"12-report.html\">终态报告</a>',\n'    </nav>',\n'    <div class=\"topbar-meta\">',\n'      <span class=\"live-indicator\"><i></i><span>监督链路在线</span></span>',\n'      <time id=\"clock\" datetime=\"\">--:--:--</time>',\n'    </div>',\n'  </header>',\n'',\n'  <main id=\"main-content\">',\n'    <nav class=\"breadcrumb section-shell\" aria-label=\"面包屑导航\">',\n'      <a href=\"../index.html\">总览</a><span>/</span><a href=\"../index.html#mechanisms\">机制矩阵</a><span>/</span><span>' + c.id + ' ' + c.name + '</span>',\n'    </nav>',\n'',\n'    <section class=\"page-hero section-shell\">',\n'      <div>',\n'        <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span>MECHANISM ' + c.id + '</span> / ' + c.en.toUpperCase() + '</p>',\n'        <h1>' + c.name + '</h1>',\n'        <p class=\"page-lead\">' + c.lead + '</p>',\n'        <dl class=\"page-meta\">',\nM,\n'        </dl>',\n'      </div>',\n'      <div class=\"diagram\">',\n'        <p class=\"diagram-title\">' + c.diagram.title + '</p>',\nrows,\n'      </div>',\n'    </section>',\n'',\n'    <div class=\"doc-layout section-shell\">',\n'      <article class=\"doc-main\">',\n'        <section class=\"doc-block\">',\n'          <h2>机制要点</h2>',\nwhat,\n'        </section>',\n'',\n'        <section class=\"doc-block\">',\n'          <h2>信号与判定</h2>',\n'          <table class=\"signal-table\">',\n'            <thead><tr><th>观测信号</th><th>判定含义</th></tr></thead>',\n'            <tbody>',\nsignals,\n'            </tbody>',\n'          </table>',\n'        </section>',\n'',\n'        <section class=\"doc-block\">',\n'          <h2>触发与处置</h2>',\n'          <ol class=\"step-list\">',\nsteps,\n'          </ol>',\n'        </section>',\n'',\n'        <section class=\"doc-block\">',\n'          <h2>失效模式</h2>',\nfailure,\n'          <div class=\"callout' + (c.callout.danger ? ' is-danger' : '') + '\">',\n'            <div><strong>' + c.callout.title + '</strong> ' + c.callout.text + '</div>',\n'          </div>',\n'        </section>',\n'      </article>',\n'',\n'      <aside class=\"doc-aside\">',\n'        <div class=\"panel\">',\n'          <h3>参数速查</h3>',\n'          <dl class=\"spec-list\">',\nspec,\n'          </dl>',\n'        </div>',\n'        <div class=\"panel\">',\n'          <h3>关联机制</h3>',\n'          <ul class=\"link-list\">',\nrelated,\n'          </ul>',\n'        </div>',\n'      </aside>',\n'    </div>',\n'',\n'    <nav class=\"pager section-shell\" aria-label=\"章节翻页\">',\n'      <div class=\"pager-links\">',\n'        ' + prevLink,\n'        ' + nextLink,\n'      </div>',\n'      <span class=\"pager-index\">' + pagerIndex + '</span>',\n'    </nav>',\n'  </main>',\n'',\n'  <footer class=\"site-footer section-shell\">',\n'    <div>',\n'      <a class=\"brand footer-brand\" href=\"../index.html\">',\n'        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>',\n'        <span><strong>Agent Oversight</strong><small>静态监控台</small></span>',\n'      </a>',\n'      <p>本页为监管机制说明之一，全部内容为静态文件，无后端依